                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"310\" height=\"386\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">R3\nint l0\nip add 2.2.2.2 255.255.255.255\nip ospf 123 area 0\nno sh\n\nint e0/1\nip add 12.12.12.2 255.255.255.252\nip ospf 123 area 0\nno sh\n\nint e0/0\nip add 23.23.23.1 255.255.255.252\nip ospf 123 area 0\nno sh\n\nrouter ospf 123\nmpls ldp autoconfig</text></svg>",
